<title>POLAND: Mostostal-Z revises up 1996 net sales.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-Z revises up 1996 net sales.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>    JANUARY-DECEMBER			 1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit			12.82 vs    5.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  12.82 vs    8.01</p>
<p>    Net profit				 9.04 vs    6.85</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Mostostal Zabrze SA. Earlier company said the net sales was at 206.84 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    Net sales				209.87 vs   142.93</p>
<p>    Costs of sales			 182.89 vs   124.53</p>
<p>    Extraordinary			    0.01 vs     0.23 loss</p>
<p>    Income tax				 3.78 vs    1.16</p>
<p>    Other taxes				 na  vs     na</p>
<p>    Financial revenues		    70.97 vs   27.09</p>
<p>    Financial costs			 71.31 vs   25.11</p>
<p>    Investment				 0.73 vs    1.05</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
